# MC 10140.9 (owner ruling 2026-10-15, "rec on all"): the fix-c6 probe records under the workflow-explode concept are RATIFIED tracked files — knut cron reverify reads these served records back, and untracking them would expose them to `git clean`. Directory components must be un-excluded too: git cannot re-include a file inside a still-excluded directory. Scope is this one run dir; every other `.audits/` run dir stays untracked.
!projects/portfolio/concepts/workflow-explode/.audits/
